1
00:00:00,988 --> 00:00:03,545
As uke comes to grab both shoulder from behind

2
00:00:03,846 --> 00:00:04,753
lead him to you

3
00:00:07,254 --> 00:00:09,088
As he comes round for the other shoulder

4
00:00:09,089 --> 00:00:10,687
step forward and cut down

5
00:00:11,788 --> 00:00:13,872
as you do so Uke passes you

6
00:00:13,873 --> 00:00:15,438
control the opposite wrist,

7
00:00:15,939 --> 00:00:19,588
turn him all the way around against him 
so you apply the Sankyo

8
00:00:20,089 --> 00:00:23,277
as Uke comes completely around you 
control his shoulder

9
00:00:23,278 --> 00:00:25,331
cut down to your side for the throw.

